{
  "title": "Taweez against Deafness",
  "data": "Imam al-Baqir (a.s.) is reported to have said: Put your hand on the ailing ear and recite the last four verses of [Surah al-Hashr](A63) (59:21-24), which begin:\nلَوْ اَنْزَلْنَا هٰذَا الْقُرْاٰنَ عَلٰى جَبَلٍ\nLAW ANZALNAA HAADHAL QUR'AANA A'LAA JABAL\nHad We sent down this Qur'an on a mountain...\nThese four verses are given in full in [Taweez against Warts](I46)."
}
